  triage:title "Governing documents present AJ.6's wire-compatibility contract as fully reconciled despite no compatibility fixture existing" ;
  triage:description "AJ.6 required compatibility fixtures proving a new reader accepts a pre-AJ snapshot without members and an older reader ignores the additive field. No such fixture exists in the repository, yet the governing documents (docs/requirements.md, ADR-045) present the wire-compatibility contract as fully reconciled fact. Confirmed by req-qa, arch-qa. QA source: PR #744, phase-aj-s9-qa-1. Cross-reference: AJ6-ATM-QA-003-COMPAT-FIXTURES-MISSING." ;
